## Ignore .xmKeyFile (contains dummy key, but potential real key should probably never be pushed)
.xmKeyFile*
## Don't push ximeraserve (Obsolete now: till 11/2024 used instead of .xmKeyFile)
*.ximeraserve*
#
## Graphics - recommend to be ignored, as TikZ-generated pictures should NOT be committed
*.svg
*.png
*.pdf
## Folder xmPictures is in the graphicspath, and should contain the pictures used in \graphicspath
## So png,svg,pdf,jpg in (subfolders of) xmPictures presumably must be committed
## but everything else in there should be ignored
xmPictures/**
!xmPictures
!xmPictures/**/
!xmPictures/**/*.jpg
!xmPictures/**/*.svg
!xmPictures/**/*.pdf
!xmPictures/**/*.png
!xmPictures/**/*.tex
## Note: capital JPG/PDF/PNG should NOT be used ...
!xmPictures/**/*.JPG
!xmPictures/**/*.SVG
!xmPictures/**/*.PDF
!xmPictures/**/*.PNG
## Core latex/pdflatex auxiliary files:
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.fmt
*.fot
*.out
*.toc
*.failed

# ximera-downloads contains (downloadable!) PDF's generated by xake (bakehanout/bakestandaard)
ximera-downloads

# potential key stuff (presumably not used after 2024-11)
.gpg
.gpgkey
gpgkey

# Sizing of pictures (TikZ)
*.xbb

# File used to update DevEnv config-files (xmlatex updateDevEnv)
xmDevEnvFiles.tgz
